-- CHARSET
-- Production is ALREADY utf8mb4 / utf8mb4_bin at server, database and column
-- level (verified: character_set_server=utf8mb4; every existing text column on
-- script_factory_outputs reports utf8mb4_bin). The utf8mb3 emoji-truncation risk
-- was a SANDBOX-only condition and does not exist here. New text columns below
-- still carry an explicit CHARACTER SET utf8mb4 so they cannot inherit a
-- different default if one is ever changed.
--
-- BLAST RADIUS (live row counts at time of writing)
--   script_factory_outputs           5 rows   (all status='draft')
--   analog_data_entries              1 row
--   collective_sourcing_candidates   0 rows
-- TiDB performs schema changes online and non-blocking, and these are tiny
-- tables. Expect sub-second per statement. No downtime window is required for
-- the DDL itself.
